(- Number of Subnets created = 2^b \(where b = borrowed bits from host field\).) Tj
T*
(- Total IP addresses per subnet = 2^h \(where h = remaining host bits\).) Tj
T*
(- Usable host addresses per subnet = 2^h - 2 \(subtracting Network ID where all host bits) Tj
T*
(= 0, and Directed Broadcast ID where all host bits = 1\).) Tj
T*
