(>> 5.3 IPv6 Protocol Architecture) Tj
T*
/F1 9 Tf
() Tj
T*
(* Motivation: Complete exhaustion of IPv4 32-bit address space \(4.3 billion) Tj
T*
(addresses\).) Tj
T*
(* Specifications: 128-bit address length written as eight 16-bit hexadecimal blocks) Tj
T*
(separated by colons \(e.g., 2001:0db8:85a3:0000:0000:8a2e:0370:7334\).) Tj
T*
(* Total IPv6 Address Space: 2^128 approx 3.4 x 10^38 addresses \(virtually) Tj
T*
(inexhaustible\).) Tj
T*
(* Zero Compression Rules: Leading zeros in a block can be dropped \(e.g., 0000 becomes) Tj
T*
(0\); consecutive blocks of zeros can be replaced ONCE by a double colon \(::\).) Tj
T*
(* Architectural Enhancements: Simplified 40-byte fixed header, elimination of) Tj
T*
(broadcast \(replaced by multicast/anycast\), mandatory IPSec security, Stateless) Tj
T*
(Address Autoconfiguration \(SLAAC\).) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
/F2 9.5 Tf
(>> 5.4 Transport Layer Protocols: TCP vs UDP) Tj
T*
/F1 9 Tf
() Tj
T*
(* Transmission Control Protocol \(TCP\): Connection-oriented, highly reliable,) Tj
T*
(guaranteed ordered byte-stream delivery. Features: 3-way handshake \(SYN, SYN-ACK,) Tj
T*
(ACK\), cumulative acknowledgments, sequence numbers, flow control \(sliding window\),) Tj
T*
(congestion control \(Slow Start, Congestion Avoidance, Fast Retransmit\).) Tj
T*
(* User Datagram Protocol \(UDP\): Connectionless, lightweight, unreliable, low-overhead) Tj
T*
(datagram service. No handshakes, no acknowledgments, no ordering. Used for real-time) Tj
T*
(applications: VoIP, live video streaming, DNS lookups, online multiplayer gaming.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
/F2 9.5 Tf
(>> 5.5 Core Application and Support Protocols) Tj
T*
/F1 9 Tf
() Tj
T*
(* DNS \(Domain Name System - UDP/TCP Port 53\): Distributed hierarchical database) Tj
T*
(translating human-friendly domain names \(e.g., lpu.in\) into machine routable IP) Tj
T*
(addresses.) Tj
T*
(* DHCP \(Dynamic Host Configuration Protocol - UDP Ports 67/68\): Automatically assigns) Tj
T*
(IP, subnet mask, default gateway, and DNS servers via the 4-step DORA process) Tj
T*
