(* 1. Engineering \(400 hosts\):) Tj
T*
(- 2^h - 2 >= 400 -> h = 9 \(2^9 - 2 = 510 hosts\). Mask = 32 - 9 = /23 \(255.255.254.0\).) Tj
T*
(- Allocate: 172.16.0.0/23 \(Range: 172.16.0.1 - 172.16.1.254; Broadcast: 172.16.1.255\).) Tj
T*
(Next available = 172.16.2.0.) Tj
T*
(* 2. Sales \(120 hosts\):) Tj
T*
(- 2^h - 2 >= 120 -> h = 7 \(2^7 - 2 = 126 hosts\). Mask = 32 - 7 = /25 \(255.255.255.128\).) Tj
T*
(- Allocate: 172.16.2.0/25 \(Range: 172.16.2.1 - 172.16.2.126; Broadcast: 172.16.2.127\).) Tj
T*
(Next available = 172.16.2.128.) Tj
T*
(* 3. Admin \(50 hosts\):) Tj
T*
(- 2^h - 2 >= 50 -> h = 6 \(2^6 - 2 = 62 hosts\). Mask = 32 - 6 = /26 \(255.255.255.192\).) Tj
T*
(- Allocate: 172.16.2.128/26 \(Range: 172.16.2.129 - 172.16.2.190; Broadcast:) Tj
T*
(172.16.2.191\). Next available = 172.16.2.192.) Tj
T*
(* 4. WAN Link \(2 hosts\):) Tj
T*
(- 2^h - 2 >= 2 -> h = 2 \(2^2 - 2 = 2 hosts\). Mask = 32 - 2 = /30 \(255.255.255.252\).) Tj
T*
(- Allocate: 172.16.2.192/30 \(Range: 172.16.2.193 - 172.16.2.194; Broadcast:) Tj
T*
(172.16.2.195\).) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
() Tj
